		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=27111#p27111"><![CDATA[
It took some years before I sat down to fix the code, but Dynamica is now deterministic across different runs (just make sure to reset to the first frame every time before simulating)<br><br>It should be fixed from revision 139 onwards, <a href="http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/source/detail?r=139" class="postlink">http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/source/detail?r=139</a><br><br>Note that under Linux you can use the Extras/MayaBullet/Makefile, and for Windows you can use cmake<br>Thanks,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Sat Feb 18, 2012 8:53 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
