		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=18018#p18018"><![CDATA[
Bullet is deterministic, as long as you reset all values properly when you restart.<br><br>We don't do this at the moment in Maya Dynamica, so the simulation is different each time. I filed an issue here <a href="http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=2" class="postlink">issue right here</a>, so you can keep track of the progress.<br>Thanks a lot,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Thu Mar 25, 2010 8:08 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
